  "description": "Objective 2, Step 8. Deployed setup (fixed in Step 7 on dev): always retrieve, k = 3 compact chunks, soft fallback that leaves the message unchanged, rule rag_always_rule_b, short reply when a shown card is re-fetched, warm-up. Greedy, seed 42, scaled catalogue. Secondary runs, both models, test retrieval questions: retrieval without any fallback, and retrieval as a search_knowledge tool. About 4-5 hours.",
